are associated with poorer academic performance and delayed circadian and sleep/wake timing. Scientific Reports. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41598-017-03171-4","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1038/s41598-017-03171-4"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41598-017-03171-4","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["出典を開く"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["著者の注記"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["この研究は1つのみであり、人数も少なく、対照群を用いたグループ分けも行われていません。研究者は、体内時計の差は主に毎日浴びる光の量の違いに起因すると推測しています。したがって、起床時間を固定する場合は、効果を出すために朝に光を浴びることを組み合わせる必要があります。たまに夜更かしをした後の補い方については、第 2 節の第 38 条（夜更かしした翌日の夜に補う方法）を参照してください：方法は、翌日の昼過ぎまで寝ることではなく、その日の夜に早めに床に就くことです。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["自分のメモ"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["自分へのメモを書く…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/ja/tip/03-01"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidt